      "content": "thanks for the suggestion. the faraday cage idea makes sense but i'm worried about my equipment... if i shield my desk will i also block the actual wireless signals i need for work? and do u think i should look for a specific 'counter-frequency' to play in my studio to cancel out the suppression? like, if i knew the hertz range they're using, could i just broadcast the opposite to neutralize it?",
